WEBVTT

1
00:00:04,300 --> 00:00:06,300
There is only one most important thing now

2
00:00:06,300 --> 00:00:07,500
find great people

3
00:00:07,500 --> 00:00:09,900
Otherwise, more people will die tonight

4
00:00:09,900 --> 00:00:12,020
But the Yuyan family is gone

5
00:00:12,020 --> 00:00:13,420
How do we find great people?

6
00:00:13,420 --> 00:00:15,220
Who can check the great man?

7
00:00:15,220 --> 00:00:19,220
I just said that you are the one who should protect the Yuyan family.

8
00:00:19,220 --> 00:00:21,020
Last night you said everyone should stay where they are and don't move.

9
00:00:21,020 --> 00:00:22,420
In the end, Yuyanjia died anyway

10
00:00:22,420 --> 00:00:23,420
are you a great man

11
00:00:23,420 --> 00:00:24,620
Did you kill him?

12
00:00:24,620 --> 00:00:26,020
Are you sick?

13
00:00:26,020 --> 00:00:28,460
It was you who had your hand next to Zhang Lei last night

14
00:00:28,460 --> 00:00:30,260
I would say you are the biggest suspect

15
00:00:30,260 --> 00:00:31,260
You are closest to him

16
00:00:31,260 --> 00:00:33,060
Something happened to him and nothing happened to you?

17
00:00:33,060 --> 00:00:35,660
How do you explain stop?

18
00:00:35,660 --> 00:00:47,000
who are you

19
00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:54,570
Who am I, the real Yu Yanjia?

20
00:00:54,570 --> 00:00:56,790
Yuyanjia

21
00:00:56,790 --> 00:00:59,880
What did you say, I said

22
00:00:59,880 --> 00:01:02,280
I am the only royal speaker in the room
